node_modules/
package-lock.json
# tsp-output/ is intentionally checked in: downstream Rust and C++
# builds consume the openapi.yaml / .proto files directly, and we want
# them to compile without requiring Node.js to be installed. Editors of
# the .tsp files MUST run `npm run build` before committing so the
# checked-in artifacts stay in sync; CI verifies via `verify.ps1`.
